{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":30869,"ns":0,"title":"Tesla turbine","extract":"The Tesla turbine is a bladeless centripetal-flow turbine invented by Nikola Tesla in 1913. It functions as nozzles apply a moving fluid to the edges of a set of discs.","description":"Bladeless centripetal flow turbine","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}